  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lokaler till org. f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Premises for human rights organizations - To Diakonia for Offices</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution aims to provide some CSOs in Mozambique with opportunity to buy premises for their activities, for ex for office space or      space for legal aid centers and similar. The support aims to increase democratic participation through CSO participation in society, which  will be feasible to a greater degree if CSOs can use budget for other costs than rent, avoid eviction &amp; increase sustainability of orgs/CS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens syfte &#xe4;r att ge n&#xe5;gra CSO i Mocambique m&#xf6;jlighet att k&#xf6;pa lokaler f&#xf6;r sin verksamhet, t.ex. kontorslokaler men ocks&#xe5; lokaler    till r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lps-centra och liknande. St&#xf6;det avser &#xf6;ka demokratiut&#xf6;vandet genom CSOs deltagande i samh&#xe4;llet vilket           m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;rs till st&#xf6;rre grad n&#xe4;r de kan anv&#xe4;nda sin budget till annat  &#xe4;n hyra, inte hotas av vr&#xe4;kning, och &#xf6;kar sin b&#xe4;rkraftighet /CS</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this contribution was to provide a number of CSOs in Mozambique with an opportunity to purchase premises for their activities, for an example office space or space for legal aid centers. The idea was that through this support, the same CSOs could use budget for other costs than rent, avoid eviction and increase sustainability. Renting out of some extra office space would also provide some extra income. 

The CSOs were beneficiaries under the AGIR programme, implemented by Diakonia, IBIS and Oxfam Novib. Diakonia was tasked with the responsibility to implement the project activity and the embassy was to approve (no objections) the purchases of the properties. Contracts were signed between the organisations and Diakonia, specifying the terms of the use of the premises. The premises were registered under the new owners, whom would receive full rights after five years.</narrative>
  </description>
